t_dedup\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Protected-only whitespace labels survive, different multiplicities and characters differ, and equivalent escaped and quoted spaces deduplicate.\",\n+      \"input\": \"\\\" \\\",\\\"  \\\",\\\"\\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\f\\\",\\\\ , \\t \",\n+      \"expected\": [\" \", \"  \", \"\\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\f\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"empty_quotes_do_not_split_runs\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Empty quoted segments emit no protected character, so neighboring ordinary whitespace belongs to a single run and boundary trimming still applies.\",\n+      \"input\": \"A \\t\\\"\\\"\\r B, \\\"\\\" \\tC\\\"\\\"\\n \",\n+      \"expected\": [\"a b\", \"c\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"normalized_dedup_order\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Deduplicate after lowercasing, trimming, collapsing, and removing quote delimiters, retaining first occurrence order.\",\n+      \"input\": \" Beta ,ALPHA,bETA,\\\"alpha\\\",A \\t B,a b,GAMMA,\\\"Be\\\"TA\",\n+      \"expected\": [\"beta\", \"alpha\", \"a b\", \"gamma\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"dedup_uses_output_not_provenance\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Equal normalized strings deduplicate regardless of protection history; protected boundary spaces and double spaces remain distinct.\",\n+      \"input\": \"A B,\\\"A B\\\",A\\\\ B,\\\" A B \\\",A\\\"  \\\"B,a  b\",\n+      \"expected\": [\"a b\", \" a b \", \"a  b\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"escaped_boundary_whitespace\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Ordinary boundary whitespace trims up to protected characters; ordinary whitespace between protected characters stays internal and collapses.\",\n+      \"input\": \" \\t\\\\ A\\\\ \\r\\n, \\t\\\\  \\r\\\\ \\n\",\n+      \"expected\": [\" a \", \"   \"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"other_ascii_literals\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Digits, punctuation, NUL, DEL, and ASCII file separator remain literal; only ASCII uppercase letters lowercase and only the six specified whitespace characters normalize.\",\n+      \